  rdfs:label "Other organization's content removed from the core set, 2026-10-19T04:22:12Z"@en ;
  dct:description "Verizon content was removed: 24 foreign individuals and datatypes from the compliance taxonomy; Verizon organization units (enterprise data and artificial intelligence, data and artificial intelligence governance, data and artificial intelligence and its hub-and-spoke unit, end to end governance, global network and technology) from the party vocabulary and taxonomy; Hum from the product vocabulary and taxonomy. The compliance and services taxonomy descriptions and the business unit definition were reworded without the company name; definitions were written for international standards organization, subsecond and relative. 0 blocking conformance errors remained. Changed outside the KE Workbench; recorded retrospectively on 2026-10-19T19:06:10Z."@en ;
